            "text": "Update the caller's event stream configuration — `enabled`, watched `event_names`, or the Slack delivery target (`slack_integration`, `slack_channel_id`, `slack_channel_name`). Omitted fields are left unchanged. Manage member accounts via the add/remove account tools, not here.",
            "source": {
